From: J1 Android 14 Port <j1-port@local>
Date: Mon, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] cgroup2: enable cgroup v2 support in kernel config

Android 14's libprocessgroup requires cgroup v2 hierarchy mounted
on /sys/fs/cgroup. Enable necessary configs to support this.

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/j120f_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/j120f_defconfig
--- a/arch/arm/configs/j120f_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/j120f_defconfig
@@ -15,2 +15,7 @@ CONFIG_CGROUPS=y
+CONFIG_CGROUP_BPF=y
+CONFIG_MEMCG=y
+CONFIG_MEMCG_SWAP=y
+CONFIG_BLK_CGROUP=y
+CONFIG_CGROUP_SCHED=y
+CONFIG_CGROUP_FREEZER=y
